Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是卡森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Carson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at Hilltop Colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡了一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been asleep for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.01,0:00:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的胎盘早期剥离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suffered from the condition abruptio placentae.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是胎盘与子宫分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a separation of the placenta from uterus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么早出现很不寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unusual this early,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  可能由创伤引起\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh...could be caused by trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:35.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也许是因为你腹部的瘀伤  -我是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Possibly the bruises on your abdomen -- - Did I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...lose...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.16,0:00:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有小部分分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation was small.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.51,0:00:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子的心率正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby's heart rate is normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得缓几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you need to take it easy for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可不想加剧分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to exacerbate the separation any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你怀孕期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I really think you need to stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:12.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都该待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the duration of your pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果发生了别的事  我能处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything else happens, I can take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点  慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy, easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能再说一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you say that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:34.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh -- you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:56.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们俩在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they both?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这在格伦的口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in Glenn's pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕只有一根雪茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}All Abraham had was a cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉一切都不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like everything is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并非一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉我你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me that you're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你只用在接下来几天里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you'll just have to take it easy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保重身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the next few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我说我们得留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me that we have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:48.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他在附近会好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's better if he's close,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一  直到孩子出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in case, till the baby's born.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:03:59.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:07.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见你起来了真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to see you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:09.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你放的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你床边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones on your bed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在书上看到  蓝色的花\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read somewhere that blue flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能激发力量  带来平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}inspire strength and calming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绿色的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's green?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地你终于醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you're finally awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:36.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人说你们把他们全消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people said you got them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是一个哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just an outpost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-How many of them were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.55,0:04:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许几百个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道你们逼我们接受的协议吗  玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they know the deal you made us take, Marsha?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是玛姬  - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Maggie. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也没逼你们接受协议  格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we didn't make you take the deal, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴我们能为你治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I...I'm happy we could patch you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保瑞奇知道我们为你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you let Rich know what we did for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡森医生说我该留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carson said I should stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他觉得他有权做出那个决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he thinks he has the authority to make that decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他就搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.57,0:05:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她跟自己人在一起会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be safer with her own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们没有她会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll be safer without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该和玛姬保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to keep your distance from Maggie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专心于你在山顶寨的工作就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stay focused on your work here at Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不埋死者  而是火化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't bury our dead. We burn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我干的  我不住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it. I don't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里  这位是萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory, this is Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她把玛姬送来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got Maggie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她俩都是从亚历山大来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're both from Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没法...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't ---
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间记住每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't have time to keep track of everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一直在修养  耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been recuperating, too, Jesus --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,养我的刀伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a stab wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬说她的人能搞定救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie said that her people could take care of the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如今他们只是让我们的社区陷入险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-So far, all they've done is put our community at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.49,0:05:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如他们看见你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if they see you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会以为我们是一伙儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll think we colluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们确实是一伙儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没同意你们这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not agree to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如他们觉得我们帮你们袭击了哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they think we helped attack their outpost,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也会这样对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll do that to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:08.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣  你知不知道什么叫装糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, do you have any idea what plausible deniability means?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就该明白  这是我们逃避惩罚的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you know it's our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:14.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如她俩离开  我们就能装糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they leave, we have plausible deniability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:15.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里  天快黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory, it -- it'll be night soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们现在离开不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe for them to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧  我是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以留下来过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但明早就得离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But leave in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:28.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们今晚再好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk more about it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我心意已决\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得  也许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying that maybe --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想和她俩一起走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to go back with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会送她俩回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我的意思是...  -我知道你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I meant -- - I know what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:48.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie is pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是她自己犯的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... that's her mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该和我们一起去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得有人留下来照看朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to be here for Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人可以照看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's people who want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:00.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最多只出去几天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll only be gone a few days at the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很快就会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be coming back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后就成这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how it's gonna be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:09.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几天后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.77,0:08:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会想明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...到楼下等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh, meet you downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们改变主意了的话...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You change your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're headed north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过两天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.55,0:09:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么没和我爸一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you go with my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得想清楚一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to figure some things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么要想清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is there to figure out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要如何做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们能做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少不是像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸可不是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad thinks differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.60,0:09:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.31,0:09:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我确实这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I think he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会儿换绷带  对奥利维亚好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change your bandage later, and be nice to Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:17.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去见玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要走着去山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're walking to the Hilltop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.49,0:10:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比你射得准\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have better aim than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再救你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saving you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说在武器库的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened in the armory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:54.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你安全回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it back in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾你看到了那场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you had to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.30,0:11:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:33.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的没法说服你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure I can't talk you into
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去住巴林顿公馆的空房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking the extra room at Barrington House?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是要说一下  有你在我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth, I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就劝格雷戈里改变主意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then make Gregory change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会试试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这里的人需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the people need me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:00.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果只剩下格雷戈里  可能会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was just Gregory, it'd be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么不掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why aren't you in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是那种人  我不是领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me. I'm not a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:10.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果让玛姬留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Maggie can stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会帮山顶寨搜集物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll scavenge, for the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们保护她  我会替她做贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay her way if you just keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里会同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would Gregory go for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:25.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎样  耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Jesus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要这里变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want this place to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just try to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你该做得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you got to do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个  是亚伯拉罕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, uh...This was Abraham's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我认识的人中唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was...one of the only people I'd ever met
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.89,0:13:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能讲出好笑又气人的话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who could say things that make you smile and wince at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:26.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你铺好床了  还摆了几件衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the bed for you and laid out some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:34.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以它们更多是实用而不是舒适\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they're more utility than comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会住很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be here much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对所有这些事  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, about all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会试试看我能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...gonna see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么火化死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you burn your dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea was just to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:59.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们靠什么来铭记逝者呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you have to remember 'em by?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:01.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.71,0:14:07.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明早见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以硬留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:28.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里能怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can Gregory do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里他掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:33.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懦夫更危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一晚上时间来考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the night. Let's think on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:41.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上就会想清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things will be clearer in the mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.97,0:15:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(空气)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想兜兜风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt like a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大门开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有火\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,音乐是从一辆车里传出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The music is coming from a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得关了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to turn that thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡森医生不让你站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carson told you to stay off your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you do this by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:38.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙一个人在下面  她需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha's alone down there! She needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去把门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those gates closed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你好  -抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - ‭Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to close the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到那场面你不遗憾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sorry you saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:45.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我眼睁睁得看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两次都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有移开视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:20:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为在那个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, when it was happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我得牢牢记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that I needed to remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以当我有机会杀他时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I had the chance to kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.74,0:20:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:11.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我也会杀他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd kill him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很糟糕  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's messed up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:20.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会为爱的人做一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do things for the ones you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有爱过的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉把你锁在武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I locked you in the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要看那场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't need to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们甚至不知道她是否还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't even know if she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.62,0:20:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:47.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不关心她们做了什么  回答是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what they did. The answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会赶走一个曾经帮过我们的孕妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not turning away a pregnant woman who helped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会赶走萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not turning away Sasha, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.31,0:21:00.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁是萨沙  -她们要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell is Sasha? - They're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掌权的不是你  耶稣  是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in charge, Jesus. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才是要保证这地方安全的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who has to look after the safety of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你是说你想管事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you telling you want to call the plays,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:09.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过这么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我打理好一切以后吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I set the table here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被破坏的门  救世军  居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}The broken gate, the Saviors, the people --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有都是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of this can be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是你得多留五分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you'd have to stick around for more than five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得成为这地方的一分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd actually have to be a part of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:27.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚让凯特琳小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I-I was just telling Ms. Caitlin
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿一点她最出名的大黄果酱给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring up some of her famous rhubarb preserves for you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our way of saying thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们昨晚的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}for helping out last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.37,0:21:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是梅特琳小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ms. Maitlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.39,0:21:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你们离开的时候可以带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take them with you when you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在就该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should go now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:47.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为救世军随时都会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the Saviors could get back any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.59,0:21:51.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我会走的  -萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go. - Sasha...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但让她留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let her stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-昨晚我们就算扯平了  -不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll call it even on last night. - No deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.65,0:21:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是谢谢有你们在的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's been lovely having you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:04.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me how we can make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们俩需要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'd need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-单独聊聊  好好探讨...  -去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- meet on that one-on-one just to explore -- - Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.03,0:22:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的在暗示...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you actually imply--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You know what? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得让凯特琳小姐先别端果酱上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell Ms. Caitlin to keep her preserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们要发现你们在这里会做什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they'll do if they find you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.16,0:22:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣  把她们藏进壁橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, get them in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:36.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 格雷戈里  - 赶紧进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gregory. - Go get in there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.09,0:22:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许动  不许说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't move, you don't speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.25,0:22:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你们还能保住性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe you'll get out of this alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:14.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们好  -你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.28,0:24:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.40,0:24:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是在下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty as charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.19,0:24:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-欢迎来到山顶寨  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome to Hilltop Colony. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.97,0:24:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当...在自己家一样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do, uh... make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.10,0:24:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是什么社交拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a social call.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.13,0:24:44.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我也觉得不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I -- I wouldn't think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.69,0:24:47.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.46,0:24:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方人多闷得慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's getting a little claustrophobic in here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.17,0:24:56.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的书房谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk in your study.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.22,0:24:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不记得是谁告诉我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't remember who told me about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.05,0:25:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我相信现在都无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm pretty sure it doesn't matter much anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:07.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你有没有听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know if you heard what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.29,0:25:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.81,0:25:11.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来和你打交道的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, those people you used to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.35,0:25:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们全副武装的兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our brothers and sisters in arms and operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.27,0:25:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经不再管事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, they've been removed from the field of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.51,0:25:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, brothers and sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:21.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What -- W-w-what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.32,0:25:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你知道是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.58,0:25:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we need to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.17,0:25:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.70,0:25:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于昨天晚上的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In -- in regarding last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.02,0:25:52.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}m-m-message received.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.60,0:25:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.94,0:25:57.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:01.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it was loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.99,0:26:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你是想让我们明白谁才是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just I -- I think you were showing us who was boss, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.96,0:26:13.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.42,0:26:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美到窒息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just breathtaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.94,0:26:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.93,0:26:24.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是统治的榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's management by example.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.01,0:26:28.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总得处理这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap you got to deal with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.79,0:26:30.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.62,0:26:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.43,0:26:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们努力想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was us working our asses off
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.90,0:26:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你看到了一个榜样\N{\fnArial\fs30}to provide you an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.91,0:26:49.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.66,0:26:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的人说不定都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People in here probably forget
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.91,0:26:55.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the corpses look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.38,0:27:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what they smell like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本打算为你杀了它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we were gonna kill them for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来提醒你  我们能提供的服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remind you of the service we can provide,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.83,0:27:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们自己收拾了残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you cleaned up the mess yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.74,0:27:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.23,0:27:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们肯定是从你们那里学了不少本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we must have picked up some skills from your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.83,0:27:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if you think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.65,0:27:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是你们救了我们  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you still saved us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.94,0:27:29.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样想很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a nice way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.50,0:27:30.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.59,0:27:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有团队精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm a team player, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.97,0:27:34.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这就是为什么大家选了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I-I think that's why the people chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前打交道的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the other people of ours your were dealing with? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:42.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.91,0:27:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你这这样的人合作被惯坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}got spoiled working with a guy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.97,0:27:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  -确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, well... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.41,0:27:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我觉得他们可能有些心慈手软了  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think they might've got a little soft. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.13,0:27:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会被赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what got them butchered, I imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.33,0:27:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.69,0:28:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very, very dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.02,0:28:03.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当透\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extremely dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  这事已经解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.16,0:28:19.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为杀了他们的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the people that killed them,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.81,0:28:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在为我们卖命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they work for us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.74,0:28:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道他们可是很能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they are real go-getters, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.93,0:28:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um...a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.29,0:28:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会发生这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}when things like that have to happen, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.11,0:28:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  告诉尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, tell Negan
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.51,0:28:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白合作的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the benefits in, uh...crossing the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.97,0:28:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.10,0:28:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.39,0:28:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.33,0:28:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.63,0:28:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是你的尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为尼根想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's what Negan wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.39,0:29:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能明白我们带来的好处  这意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means a lot that you recognize what we bring to the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.42,0:29:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是你为什么还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're still here, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.32,0:29:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而其他人不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}others aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.39,0:29:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.96,0:29:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样很好  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is. It's good. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.87,0:29:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还有什么想告诉我的吗  -没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything else you want me to know? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.46,0:29:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么幺蛾子需要我留意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any hitches in the giddyap I should be aware of?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.47,0:29:49.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.69,0:30:05.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.47,0:30:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是...  -威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is, uh-- - ‭Scotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:49.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是普通的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not just --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.94,0:30:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.21,0:30:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝起来像烟灰缸和玻璃清洁剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like, um, ashtrays and window cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.12,0:30:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢琴酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a gin man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.78,0:31:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过看起来确实是好货\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this does look like it could harden a connoisseur.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.42,0:31:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,态度不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a gesture.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.46,0:31:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you hate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.91,0:31:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan'll love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.56,0:31:10.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟他说是我送的  不提你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna say it's from me, not mention you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.08,0:31:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很想抢这个功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really want the headline on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.19,0:31:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好吗  -但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - ‭But, uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.25,0:31:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不把那瓶放回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to slide that one back in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.15,0:31:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  不该用问句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I shouldn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.59,0:31:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给老子把那瓶放回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to slide that one back in, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.19,0:31:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是大事  格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is big, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.99,0:31:45.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天大的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会忘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.69,0:31:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, really appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.24,0:31:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.53,0:31:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们要扫荡一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're gonna go through the place
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.39,0:31:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿走你所有东西的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take half of everything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.88,0:32:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但只拿一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only half.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.43,0:32:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这放到尼根卡车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this to the Negan truck, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.43,0:32:09.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去  先生们  干活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exeunt, gentlemen! Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.54,0:32:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  把画拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and take the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.54,0:32:18.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一件事  格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last thing, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.09,0:32:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能给我跪下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I just get a kneel out of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.95,0:32:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.77,0:32:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.86,0:32:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跪得真实在  格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a solid kneel, Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.10,0:32:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得下次也要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember that for next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.17,0:33:27.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得尼根不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Negan's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.30,0:33:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看到他那辆黑卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see that black truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.47,0:33:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你并不是出来兜风的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't taking a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.37,0:33:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是来找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't coming to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.28,0:33:56.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就这么放过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let them get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.80,0:33:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我不能  - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know I can't. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.19,0:34:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一起去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.19,0:34:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也想杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to kill them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.29,0:34:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.42,0:34:08.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.92,0:34:12.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.07,0:34:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了亚伯拉罕  不是为了格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for Abraham, not for Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.32,0:34:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.16,0:34:21.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为自己做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.54,0:34:26.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.81,0:34:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if it all goes right...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.55,0:34:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and you do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.45,0:34:42.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你要怎么逃掉  -不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...how do you get away? - It wouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.99,0:34:44.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.53,0:35:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.91,0:35:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.81,0:35:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你逃不掉的  -我会回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't make it -- - I'm just gonna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你骗我  -不  我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're lying. - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.15,0:35:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:29.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我也不能阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.31,0:35:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会看到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.09,0:35:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.14,0:35:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你把她们藏在走廊的壁橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to hide them in the hallway closet!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.11,0:35:46.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你只说了"壁橱"\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you said "Closet."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.95,0:35:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.45,0:35:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们进来时我还没...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they came in here before I --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.74,0:35:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没来得及把我们供出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you tried to give us up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.14,0:35:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会先杀掉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would've killed you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.29,0:35:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-甜心  我在和耶稣说话  -够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, I'm talking to Jesus. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.69,0:35:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要维护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you even defending her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.78,0:35:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们变成现在这样就是因为她和瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here right now because she and -- and Rich
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.90,0:36:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没能履行诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't handle things like they said they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.72,0:36:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军想要杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors tried to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.15,0:36:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.81,0:36:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等救世军一离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as soon as the Saviors leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.43,0:36:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把她们送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get them the hell out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.61,0:36:08.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-省得真的发生惨剧  -别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- before something bad really happens. - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.47,0:36:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你想公之于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you want to make it public?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.26,0:36:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大家知道你和亚历山大做的交易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make the deal with Alexandria public?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.42,0:36:17.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉你装糊涂的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose your plausible deniability?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.27,0:36:19.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉你的权位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose your position?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.65,0:36:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这么说你现在要掌权了  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're gonna be in charge now? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.37,0:36:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过不再是你说的算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that you won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.49,0:36:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬和萨沙会留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie and Sasha are staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.76,0:36:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.80,0:36:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会成为一个不正常的欢乐大家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna be one big happy dysfunctional family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.27,0:36:44.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.99,0:36:48.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来保证我们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll see us through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.83,0:36:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天和他们达成了进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made progress with them today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.75,0:36:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你也看到了  -我看到的不是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saw it. - That's not what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.88,0:36:55.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  反正就是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, it's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.32,0:37:00.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们好好配合  他们就会善待我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We play nice, they play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.17,0:37:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军实际上是很讲道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saviors can actually be quite reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.82,0:37:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是块好表\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fine watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.61,0:37:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要丢在外面淋雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't need to be left out in the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:22.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里现在也是我们的家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.79,0:37:25.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要开始学会叫对我名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you'll learn to start to call me by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是玛莎  不是亲爱的  不是甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Marsha, not "Dear," Not "Honey."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.15,0:37:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.49,0:37:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬·李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie Rhee.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.47,0:37:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来的时候  格雷戈里已经掌权了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I got here, Gregory was already in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.95,0:37:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时以为大家出于某种原因选了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought the people chose him for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.51,0:37:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在想起来  可能只是凑巧而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at it now, I think it just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.75,0:37:49.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢他的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't like how he did things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.86,0:37:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我心中没有取代他的人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't imagine anyone else in his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.42,0:37:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.70,0:37:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.90,0:38:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以后再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about it sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.37,0:38:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该早点跟格雷戈里谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've talked to Gregory sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.32,0:38:09.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.01,0:38:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿  你们能让我做出补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully, you'll let me make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.90,0:38:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.80,0:38:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  他们还在外面装货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, they're still loading up outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.00,0:38:25.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖车里见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you back at the trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.36,0:38:39.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想补偿我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to make it up to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.27,0:38:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能找到尼根的住处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...can you find where Negan lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.16,0:38:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一辆卡车会回那里  所以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the trucks is going back there,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.76,0:38:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我可以找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.24,0:39:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能保密吗  只有我们俩知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you keep it between us, just you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.37,0:39:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不告诉玛姬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.24,0:39:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.07,0:39:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.28,0:39:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.86,0:39:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.20,0:39:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.12,0:39:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.65,0:40:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们说你开拖拉机杀了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}People told me you killed walkers and a car...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.00,0:40:14.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毁了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a tractor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.40,0:40:16.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时不能袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't sit by and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.07,0:40:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再那样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.10,0:40:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我坐着做了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess I sat and did something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.05,0:40:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你应该保重身体的  -那不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're supposed to take it easy. - It wasn't hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.90,0:40:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.08,0:40:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高中时有个男生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this boy in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.57,0:40:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开车碾了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran over the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.16,0:40:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}His car.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.97,0:40:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前是辆大黄蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a Camaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.66,0:40:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.90,0:40:45.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.50,0:40:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- I came to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.20,0:40:52.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你独自来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.84,0:40:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.08,0:40:56.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃点晚饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.81,0:41:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕的墓上为什么有气球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are there balloons on Abraham's grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.59,0:41:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不忍心告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have the heart to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.92,0:41:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.27,0:41:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他最不会说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a bad liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.19,0:41:12.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.97,0:41:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不必道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.89,0:41:16.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气球没什么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing wrong with balloons.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.08,0:41:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坟墓上没有标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing marking the graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.01,0:41:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.28,0:41:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算在格伦的墓上放这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna use this for Glenn's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.97,0:41:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.07,0:41:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他送给了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.75,0:41:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我现在要送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm giving it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.55,0:41:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要任何东西来铭记他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need anything to remember him by.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.91,0:41:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有我们就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.96,0:42:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝  为你每个早晨给我们第一道曙光\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this new morning, with its light,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.18,0:42:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你在夜晚给我们安歇和住所\N{\fnArial\fs30}for rest and shelter of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.37,0:42:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你给我们健康和食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}for health and food,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.76,0:42:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你给我们爱和朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}for love and friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.69,0:42:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你一切美好的恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}for everything that goodness sends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.97,0:42:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.81,0:42:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-阿门  -阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - ‭Amen.
